{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Release invocation plugins even when shutdown fails.** If `validateRunningThreads()` throws\u2014for example, when its wait is interrupted\u2014or `checkpointManager.shutdown()` fails, this line is skipped. A running operation or checkpoint callback can then retain the manager and continue reaching this invocation\u2019s plugin instances after invocation end. Put `releasePlugins()` in a `finally` block around the close work and cover an exceptional-close path.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7xiJiO","finding_digest":"8be88d89357984406dc950e3066d0aad39449913c90627d5dbdb399d9b642e96","finding_id":"arf_v1_rpui3cjvpgcea3ojkdrqm3ikvu","finding_key":"sdk/executionmanager::close::plugin-release-on-close-failure","identity_key":"sdk/executionmanager::close::plugin-release-on-close-failure","line":427,"observation_digest":"cc0d8cc400b420fc7ac82eb09c9cba941679122a809ff24ffbb995f83c432f92","observation_id":"aro_v1_zqgyzraawqqpy6wif2yjzhf2sq","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/ExecutionManager.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-09-19T04:51:17Z","review_id":"arr_v1_l4gsmq2zhabnhahymwmlhs5krj","reviewed_base_sha":"dd19d8efc275c4cf97e34338fff51f53957e42c6","reviewed_head_sha":"51a235fe07f6cbc3421b3a7a361046f0c232415b","reviewer":"codex","start_line":427,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":721},"record_id":"art_v1_i4nzlkvp2i55q4h3yr5oycswqt","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-19T04:51:17Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
